<p>Kingsville is the Kleberg County seat, about 40 miles southwest of Corpus Christi on US 77, home to Texas A&amp;M University-Kingsville and Naval Air Station Kingsville, with Baffin Bay and the Laguna Madre to the southeast. As a public adjuster in Kingsville, TX, we help homeowners, landlords, and business owners with hail, wind, tropical storm, and water damage claims. Corpus Christi Public Adjuster serves Kingsville from the Corpus Christi area; we do not keep an office in Kingsville and we come to the property.</p>
<p>Kingsville's older neighborhoods have many pier-and-beam and wood-frame homes under mature trees, alongside brick ranch homes, manufactured home communities, student rentals, and commercial buildings along the US 77 corridor and downtown. Older roofs, large trees, and manufactured homes all show up in the county's storm reports.</p>

<h2>Large hail in Kingsville</h2>
